              "Tab Panel On-Demand Loading",
              "Preloading on Hover / Focus",
              "Dynamic Component Selection at Runtime",
              "Named Export Remapping",
              "Factory Pattern — Reusable Lazy Wrapper",
              "Webpack Magic Comments — Chunk Naming and Prefetch",
