//   RAG          -> what is TRUE right now, and who may see it
//   PROMPTING    -> the RULES for this request
//   FINE-TUNING  -> how it SOUNDS and what SHAPE it takes
//   VALIDATION   -> whether any of it can be trusted
// Nothing here is a substitute for anything else.`,
