             <p><strong>Inside one run:</strong> max steps, a token budget, a time limit, and a money limit in real currency. The token budget matters more than the step count, because context grows every step so step eight costs far more than step one. All enforced in my loop — a <code>for</code>-loop bound is a rule, a prompt instruction is a suggestion.</p>
