    <li style="margin-top: 0.5rem;"><strong>Confirming something exists.</strong> "Is there a document about the Acme acquisition?" — answering <em>yes, but you cannot see it</em> is itself a disclosure. For genuinely confidential material, the answer must be indistinguishable from "no such thing".</li>
